  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/tnp-limitless-8\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CSkzWQh.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"194\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/siFhF5X.png\"><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/gbergz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WITgYz5.png\" width=\"1143\" height=\"112\"></a></strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/teamtnp\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0mekeoJ.png\" width=\"1143\" height=\"96\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/siFhF5X.png\" width=\"1124\" height=\"8\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>基于 NeoForge 1.21.1 的整合包</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">主开发者：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/gberqz/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gbergz</a><br>官方 GitHub 链接：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/The-Nexus-Project/Limitless-8\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub.com/TNP-Limitless-8</a><br>最新更新日志请查看：<a href=\"https://github.com/The-Nexus-Project/Limitless-8/blob/main/changelogs.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub.com/TNP-Limitless-8/Changelog</a><a href=\"https://github.com/The-Nexus-Project/Limitless-5/blob/main/changelogs.md\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/siFhF5X.png\" width=\"1124\" height=\"8\"><br></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AI5eWtC.png\" width=\"1877\" height=\"174\"></p>\n<p><strong>整合包部分特色（点击展开）：</strong><strong><br></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/siFhF5X.png\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sybeaNC.png\" width=\"242\" height=\"81\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完成最棘手的试炼，踏上冒险之旅，探索世界，烹饪美味佳肴——<br>征服地牢，击败Boss，</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">寻找庇护所，建造温馨小屋，<br>完成任务（含结局章节及创意配方）以及更多！<br>亲自加入游戏，体验这一切吧！</span><br><br>Limitless 8 目前包含 840 多个模组。<br>任务方面，目前共有 36 个章节，总计约 2230 个任务。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br>（尽管模组数量庞大，但开发时已充分考虑性能优化。LL8 几乎包含了所有你能找到的优化类模组。）<br>（已排除无效或毫无作用的模组。）<br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/siFhF5X.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在模组版 Minecraft 中完整体验全新的 1.21 棘手试炼更新，享受最佳 Minecraft 体验。</span><br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br>&nbsp;模组列表（截至 v1.64.0）：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/tnp-limitless-8/files/8445272/dependencies\" rel=\"nofollow\">[链接 - 点击此处！]（向下滚动或搜索。）</a>.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/siFhF5X.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>祝游玩愉快，</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- TNP 团队, Gbergz.</strong></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/siFhF5X.png\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>建议分配 12 GB 以上内存。（条件允许请分配更多。）</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>最低内存需求为 8 GB*。（请勿低于此值，否则无法运行。）<br></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（请确保您当前使用的启动器使用的是 Java 21。）<br></span><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">（</span> * 仅可启动的最低内存，不推荐。）</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/siFhF5X.png\"></span><a href=\"https://discord.gg/gwzpyQb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wLBDcVs.png\" width=\"461\" height=\"254\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/The-Nexus-Project/Limitless-8/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C5pSnvU.png\" width=\"463\" height=\"97\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;（图片均可点击并附带链接！）&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/siFhF5X.png\"><br><a href=\"https://github.com/The-Nexus-Project/Limitless-8/issues/1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UfEdHAB.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"147\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/siFhF5X.png\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.reddit.com/r/TeamTNP/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aAb3LwV.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7I41oba.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/siFhF5X.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.bisecthosting.com/gbergz?r=TNPLimitless8\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jCQctuc.png\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/siFhF5X.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1121\" height=\"8\"></strong><strong>由于评论区常被滥用，现已关闭评论功能。</strong><br>报告问题与 Bug 的最佳地点是我们的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/The-Nexus-Project/Limitless-8/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>[问题追踪器]</strong></a>&nbsp;或我们的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/gwzpyQb\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 频道</a>，请在 <strong>#support</strong> 板块反馈。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/siFhF5X.png\"></p>",
